[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to find the largest possible real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(z\) is a complex number with \(|z| = 4\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). Then, the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m (75 + 117i)(4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m First, let's simplify the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{24 + 36i}{1} \cdot (\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = (24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(-24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + ((24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(-24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m (4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(4(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) - 24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
