[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta = 324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m We need to maximize the real part \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\). To find the maximum value, we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a \cos \theta + b \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = -432\), so the maximum value is:
