[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m To find the maximum value of \(306\cos\theta - 459\sin\theta\), we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 306\) and \(b = -459\), so the maximum value is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
