[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=49749)[0m The maximum value of \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\) is \(R\), which is 540. Therefore, the largest possible real part of the expression is 540.
